# Built INVALID, circular: a top edge's spring on the top face runs tangent to a through hole's rim
# (the hole's centre R + D/2 from the edge). Builds valid with the hole clear of the spring. With
# the plate as thick as the radius (T = R = D = 5) the same fillet is refused (Overflow) instead.
# From CADFS 00092585 (its plate edge beside a 5 mm hole whose rim is r from the edge), restated
# in our own numbers.
shared L = 40
shared T = 8
shared R = 4
shared D = 6
param round.r = R

sketch plan(on: xy) {
  outline = rect(corner: (0, 0), size: (L, L))
}
plate = extrude(plan, T)
sketch spot(on: plate.end) {
  c = circle((L - R - D / 2, L / 2), D / 2)
}
drill = cut(spot.c, thru)
round = fillet(edges(between: (plate.end, plate.side(plan.outline[1]))), r)
